# Fact pattern — Acme target bonus (FP-059)

> Using Incentive_comp_acme as I

## FP-059 — 15% of a $165,000 base

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp059:
  output computation content I.IncentiveCompAcme

scope TestFp059:
  definition computation equals
    output of I.IncentiveCompAcme with { -- annual_base_salary: $165,000 }
  assertion computation.target_bonus = $24,750
  assertion computation.target_bonus_rate = 15%
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp059
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp059 ─
│ computation =
│   IncentiveCompAcme {
│     -- target_bonus_rate: 0.15
│     -- target_bonus: $24,750.00
│   }
└─
```
